# Marketplace and distribution

Matt asked to package this theme for sale. Follow these rules on marketplace work. README / `readme.txt` / ThemeForest documentation copy: `.cursor/rules/theme-shop-readme.mdc`.

This repo is a **concept Sage theme** for licensed-guide battlefield tours. WooCommerce powers bookable tours. Companion plugins **Hallowed Ground Bookings** and **Hallowed Ground Field Map** (`plugins/`) are sold separately in the pack — never zip them inside the theme folder for WordPress.org.

## Where the money is

| Channel | What to ship | Honest limit |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Own site** | Full pack (theme + child + optional plugins + docs) | Best margin |
| **ThemeForest / Envato** | Same pack + concept/preview URL | Reviewers expect Customizer, child theme, docs, GPL assets, no dummy license |
| **WordPress.org** | Theme zip only. No bundled plugins. `readme.txt` + `screenshot.png` (1200×900) | Sage + Acorn will likely fail first review. Lite / traffic listing later |

Do **not** add Freemius, Envato banners, affiliate chrome, or “upgrade to Pro” nags.

## Plugin territory

- Theme zip: presentation + WooCommerce theme support. No companion plugin zips inside.
- Bookings / Field Map: separate zips in the seller pack.
- WooCommerce itself: install from WordPress.org.

## Theme Check and WPCS

Escape every output (`esc_html`, `esc_attr`, `esc_url`, `wp_kses_post`). Prefix: `hg_`, `HG_`, or Acorn `App\`. **Text domain is `hallowed-ground`**. Zero notices with `WP_DEBUG` true.

## Demo data and licensing

GPL-compatible assets only. Self-hosted OFL fonts and Wikimedia / public-domain Gettysburg images in `public/images/` are OK. List every bundled resource in `CREDITS.md` / `readme.txt` Resources. Concept phones stay `555`; emails stay `@hallowedground.test`.

## Footer, admin, and identity

Author credit (Matt Hummel / matthummel.com) must be removable via **Customize → Identity**. Use `rel="nofollow noopener"`. Front-end copyright is the buyer’s site name + year. No admin upsells. Identity comes from `App\Support\Identity` / Customizer.

## Required store files

`style.css` headers, `readme.txt`, `screenshot.png`, `license.txt`, `CREDITS.md`, `child-theme/`, `docs/marketplace/` hub. Pack copies docs into `Documentation/`. Do not put `SELLING.md`, `themeforest-listing.md`, or `wordpress-org.md` inside the buyer zip.

## Do not

- Bundle Bookings / Field Map inside the theme zip
- Add theme GA / SEO metaboxes
- Leave unescaped `{!! $raw !!}` or unprefixed globals
- Claim WordPress.org approval while this is still Sage
- Hard-require a dofollow backlink
